@startuml RF42_Sequencia
title RF42 — Marcar um look como "Look do dia"\nDiagrama de sequência — marcar o look, efeitos AFTER_COMMIT (diário de uso, pontos) e sinais LOOK_WORN/PIECE_USED do HypeScore v2
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBC6BE
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A4852
}
autonumber
actor "Pessoa" as U
participant "ExpandedCard\n(components/expanded-card.tsx)" as FE
participant "LookbookController" as LC
participant "LookbookService" as LS
participant "SchemeService" as SS
participant "DailyLookService" as DS
participant "WardrobeEventListeners" as WL
participant "HypeSignalRecorder\nHypeIntegrityPolicy" as HR
participant "HypeLiveRecalc" as LR
database "MySQL" as DB

U -> FE: "Look do dia" num look próprio
FE -> LC: POST /api/me/daily-look {schemeId}
LC -> LS: markDailyLook(user, schemeId)
LS -> SS: owned(user, schemeId)
alt look inexistente
  SS --> FE: 404
else de outra pessoa
  SS --> FE: 403 (Guard.requireOwner, auditado)
end
LS -> DS: register(user, scheme, MANUAL, hoje em America/Sao_Paulo)
DS -> DB: scheme_items do look (peças)
alt peça indisponível (disponivel = false ou status ≠ AVAILABLE)
  DS --> FE: 409 PECA_INDISPONIVEL {nomes}
else
  DS -> DB: daily_looks por (user_id, look_date)
  alt já existe na data
    DS -> DB: UPDATE daily_looks (scheme_id, source)
  else
    DS -> DB: INSERT daily_looks · schemes.look_do_dia_count + 1
  end
  DS -> DB: schemes.look_do_dia = true\nwardrobe_items.look_do_dia_count + 1, last_worn_date
  DS ->> DS: publishEvent DailyLookRegistered(userId, schemeId, data, MANUAL, pieceIds)
  DS --> LS: DailyLook
  LS --> FE: 200 view {id, date, source, schemeId, title, coverImageUrl,\nfeedback, materialized, weekPlanDayId}
  FE -> FE: toast "Look do dia" e reload()
end
note over FE, DS
  Mesmo register (e mesmos eventos) a partir de: POST /api/schemes {lookDoDia: true}
  (MANUAL; recusa vira dailyLookWarning) · POST /api/autopilot/daily/confirmation e
  POST /api/autopilot/days/{dayId}/use (AUTOPILOTO) · POST /api/copilot/looks (COPILOT)
  · POST /api/me/mirror/use (VISTA_ME ou SMART_MIRROR).
end note

== Depois do commit (@TransactionalEventListener AFTER_COMMIT) ==
DS ->> WL: onDailyLook
WL -> DB: piece_usage_diary (DAILY_LOOK) · wear_count + 1
opt source = VISTA_ME
  WL -> DB: fai_points_ledger VISTA_ME_DAILY_LOOK
end
DS ->> HR: onDailyLook → SideEffectRunner (REQUIRES_NEW)
HR -> HR: weight(LOOK_WORN, look) e weight(PIECE_USED, cada peça)\nação do dono conta; dedupe hype:dedupe:…:{dia} (26 h)
HR -> DB: HypeSignalDailyRepository.increment → hype_signal_daily\n(peso 1; já contado hoje = descartado)
DS ->> LR: onDailyLook → markDirty()
LR -> LR: tick (30 s): recalcula hype_scores em até ~2 min
note right of HR: Trocar o look no mesmo dia gera novos\nsinais só para o look/peças novos.
@enduml
